--------------------------------------
PROJECT CONTEXT & PURPOSE
--------------------------------------
The app allows a user to enter a project / idea decision question.
The backend (Groq API) returns structured JSON containing:

- Problem Summary
- Primary Approach
- Alternative Approach
- Pros & Cons
- Trade-Offs
- When to Choose Each
- Optional Hybrid Strategy
- Final Recommendation

The frontend must display these results in a structured, readable way
like a comparison dashboard — NOT like a chat interface.

--------------------------------------
LAYOUT REQUIREMENTS
--------------------------------------
Follow this layout structure inspired by the image:

LEFT PANEL (Sidebar)
- App title + icon: "Trade-Off Referee"
- Input box where the user types their question
- "Compare Approaches" button
- "Recent Questions" list (static for now)
- "Hybrid Strategy" info card

RIGHT PANEL (Main Content)
1) Problem Summary card (full-width)
2) Two-column comparison layout:
   - Primary Approach card
   - Alternative Approach card

Each card must contain:
- Title
- Short description
- Pros list (green check icons)
- Cons list (red cross icons)
- Trade-Offs box
- "Choose This If" section (badge style bullets)

A footer section should display:
- Optional Hybrid Strategy
- Final Recommendation highlight

--------------------------------------
FUNCTIONALITY REQUIREMENTS
--------------------------------------
The frontend must:

- Provide a text input to submit a question
- Send request to backend endpoint `/compare`
- Receive JSON response
- Render content dynamically into the UI structure
- Show loading state while waiting
- Handle error gracefully

--------------------------------------
DATA BINDING
--------------------------------------
Bind fields to JSON keys from the backend:

problem_summary
primary_approach.title
primary_approach.description
primary_approach.pros[]
primary_approach.cons[]
primary_approach.tradeoffs
alternative_approach.title
alternative_approach.description
alternative_approach.pros[]
alternative_approach.cons[]
alternative_approach.tradeoffs
when_to_choose.choose_primary_if[]
when_to_choose.choose_alternative_if[]
optional_hybrid_strategy
final_recommendation

